# File: .worktree-config
# Description: Per-repo config for the global worktree provisioner
#   (~/.ai-dev-dotfiles/tools/setup-worktree.sh). LiveLong is single-branch (main); the app is
#   the Next.js PWA in web-app/. New units of work get an agent-agnostic sibling worktree
#   <parent>/LiveLong-<category>-<work-id> off main; the primary checkout stays the lead's
#   integration surface. WT_PROFILE=claude generates path-bound -w profiles for all four
#   wrappers (claude/codex/agy/hermes), since the livelong fleet mixes Antigravity and Claude.
# Author: Libor Ballaty <liborballaty@gmail.com>, with Claude Opus 5.5 (livelong-worker-126961, 2026-11-26-worker-126961-02)
# Created: 2026-11-26
# Reference: ~/.ai-dev-dotfiles/docs/worktree-config.schema.md
WT_BASE_BRANCH=main
WT_POST_CREATE='npm --prefix web-app install >/dev/null 2>&1 || true'
WT_CREDS=''
WT_PROFILE=claude
